# Work tracking

- Never read or write `WIP/`. It is human-owned scratch. `.cursorignore` lists `WIP/`.
- Maintain `TODO.md` as the agent task queue. One task per line. Status prefix required: `[ ]` open, `[~]` in progress, `[x]` done, `[!]` blocked.
- Include a Linear identifier when work spans sessions.
- `current_work/` is retired. Do not recreate it. Migrate leftovers to `WIP/` (human) or `TODO.md` (agent).
